'''''Heteroscyphus''''' is a genus of [[Marchantiophyta|liverworts]] in the family [[Lophocoleaceae]]. 87 species was accepted in this worldwide group in 2019.<ref>{{cite web |title=''Heteroscyphus''|work= The Plant list|url=http://www.theplantlist.org/1.1/browse/B/Geocalycaceae/Heteroscyphus/|accessdate=2019-04-12}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=''Heteroscyphus''|work= GBIF Backbone Taxonomy|url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2689466|accessdate=2019-04-12}}</ref>

